source: crates/daemon/tests/cli_help.rs
expression: stdout
---
Link tasks with the optional ms-todo CLI and keep shared fields in sync

Usage: mxr todo microsoft [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  status  Whether ms-todo is installed on the machine running the daemon
  link    Create a Microsoft task and link title, due date, schedule and status both ways
  sync    Reconcile one linked task, or all links. Conflicting edits are preserved for review
  help    Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --account <ACCOUNT>  Limit to one account; the default covers every account
      --format <FORMAT>    [possible values: table, json, jsonl, csv, ids]
  -h, --help               Print help
